OL,3,GNEWSAForce has sacked 65 staff for
OL,4,Asexual misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force says it has sacked 65
OL,7,Fofficers or staff since 2020 after
OL,8,Fsexual misconduct was proven against
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police (TVP) is the
OL,12,Flargest non-metropolitan force in
OL,13,FEngland and Wales and has periodically
OL,14,Fpublished reports of sexual misconduct
OL,15,Frelating to its employees since 2024.
OL,17,FIt said by the end of September, 129
OL,18,Fofficers or staff had been sanctioned,
OL,19,Fwith measures varying from dismissal to
OL,20,Fbeing told to undertake reflective
OL,21,Fpractice.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
